the funky fish flops on the floor
using all its energy
to get to the door.

the door.
the door.

what lies beyond the door?

perhaps the fish could explore
and learn so much more.
inch by inch
the fish
approaches the door.

no water
no food
no air
only the floor

if only the fish
could get to the door.

